  (:id "t-audit-verify-package" :type :task :title "Verify the published v0.2.2 source and release assets" :state :done
   :evidence ("https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/releases/tag/v0.2.2" "Cargo.lock" "https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/commit/be82ef36c93672c715312676d40c25e9dfeb6fff")
   :note "All 129 files in the public crate matched the rebuilt package byte for byte. The two GitHub release assets matched their published SHA-256 checksums. The OSV check of the 20 locked third-party packages returned no matching advisory on November 24, 2026.")
  (:id "t-audit-verify-compiled" :type :task :title "Run the released Rust and Go suites" :state :done
   :evidence ("Cargo.toml" "tests/go.mod" "tools/inkconvert/go.mod" "tools/load/go.mod" "tools/replay/go.mod" "tools/xsim/go.mod")
   :note "The locked Studio Rust suite passed 228 tests with seven ignored. On Linux all six packages with tests passed the race detector. All five Go modules built and passed vet. These results apply to v0.2.2.")
  (:id "t-audit-verify-hardware" :type :task :title "Verify M5 Max and Pro reference agreement and chip goldens" :state :done
   :evidence ("https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/actions/runs/45538544639/job/138951078907" "tests/ci.sh" "tests/golden.sh")
   :note "The tagged main revision matched llama.cpp at all 58 short-decode, 24 prefill and 58 batched-decode positions. On M5 Pro the corresponding worst KL divergences were 0.000001637, 0.006897324 and 0.000381056. Chip-specific goldens, lane and pool checks also passed.")
  (:id "t-audit-verify-http" :type :task :title "Check the published binary and the three-turn RAM cache on M5 Pro" :state :done
   :evidence ("tests/serve.sh" "tests/servecheck" "src/serve.rs" "https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/releases/tag/v0.2.2")
   :note "The v0.2.2 release binary passed 17 loopback API checks. A separate paged-scheduler test matched 16 cold private-lane tokens on each of three turns, reusing 10,048 and 10,112 prompt tokens. SSD qualification has a separate row.")
  (:id "t-audit-verify-models" :type :task :title "Replay shipped model traces and their negative controls" :state :done
   :evidence ("scripts/check-tla.sh" "specs" "https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/commit/be82ef36c93672c715312676d40c25e9dfeb6fff")
   :note "The v0.2.2 TLA runner accepted its positive traces and rejected the five MemMode, six blockbook, seven cache and four scheduler mutations. Its synthetic scheduler traces have separate coverage from the live planner.")
  (:id "t-audit-ci-unix-socket-path" :type :task :title "Run helper socket tests independently of checkout path length" :state :doing
   :evidence ("src/memd.rs" "https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/pull/84")
   :note "Two macOS helper tests exceeded the Unix socket pathname limit when run from a long checkout. Create a short, private scratch directory for each test and preserve isolation across concurrent runs.")
  (:id "t-audit-verify-umask-fixtures" :type :task :title "Isolate the helper socket test from concurrent recorder tests" :state :doing
   :evidence ("src/memd.rs" "src/record.rs" "https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/pull/91")
   :note "The helper socket test temporarily changes the process-wide file mask. In a parallel run a recorder fixture directory was created without search permission and rotation failed. Run the helper fixture in its own process and use a deterministic recorder write failure.")
