  (:id "layer-4" :type :roadmap :title "Layer 4: scheduler, admission and disk tier"
   :rows (
     ("l4-states" "Lane lifecycle: Queued, Admitted, Restoring, Ready, InStep, Finished; Cancelling and Cancelled")
     ("l4-pick" "Specify and verify the production decode burst, bounded prefill wait and per-step token budget")
     ("l4-bound" "No Ready, Restoring or Queued lane is passed over more than W ticks")
     ("l4-admit" "Admission by worst-case memory against the measured budget, a bounded queue, then 429 with Retry-After")
     ("l4-budget" "The memory budget read from Metal's recommended working set at start, never passed by hand")
     ("l4-mode" "Inky mode: a one-time root helper raises the GPU wired limit while inky runs and restores it when inky's connection closes, crash or not")
     ("l4-cancel" "Cancel in a step waits for the step's GPU work and disk I/O")
     ("l4-spill" "Unreferenced blocks spilled to the SSD lazily under memory pressure, least recently used first")
     ("l4-restore" "Restoring reserves the whole working set atomically before reading")
     ("l4-gate-traces" "Gate: scheduler traces are behaviours of the model, checked in CI")
     ("l4-gate-load" "Gate: a bimodal workload of 2K and 64K requests under a tight budget; disconnects in mid-step")
     ("l4-gate-kill" "Gate: kill -9 in mid-write loses cache and never correctness")
     ("l4-gate-seed" "Gate: temperature 1 with fixed seeds gives the same outputs with and without the cache")
   )
   :columns (("done" "done"))
